@api = http://localhost:5180

### List announcements as a parent
GET {{api}}/api/announcements
X-Demo-User: parent.greenfield.1

### Create an announcement as a teacher
POST {{api}}/api/announcements
X-Demo-User: teacher.greenfield
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Library books due Friday",
  "body": "Please return all borrowed library books by Friday.",
  "priority": "Normal",
  "publishNow": true
}

### Tenant isolation: Oakridge teacher cannot see Greenfield data
GET {{api}}/api/announcements
X-Demo-User: teacher.oakridge
